        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:8",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And God came unto Balaam, and said, What men are these with thee?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 48
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:9",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And Balaam said unto God, Balak the son of Zippor, king of Moab, hath sent unto me, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 84,
            "end": 91
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:10",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, there is a people come out of Egypt, which covereth the face of the earth: come now, curse me them; peradventure I shall be able to overcome them, and drive them out.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 16
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:11",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And God said unto Balaam, Thou shalt not go with them; thou shalt not curse the people: for they are blessed.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 97,
            "end": 100
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:12",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And Balaam rose up in the morning, and said unto the princes of Balak, Get you into your land: for the Lord refuseth to give me leave to go with you.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:13",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "And the princes of Moab rose up, and they went unto Balak, and said, Balaam refuseth to come with us.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:14",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "And Balak sent yet again princes, more, and more honourable than they.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:15",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "And they came to Balaam, and said to him, Thus saith Balak the son of Zippor, Let nothing, I pray thee, hinder thee from coming unto me:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:16",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "For I will promote thee unto very great honour, and I will do whatsoever thou sayest unto me: come therefore, I pray thee, curse me this people.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:17",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "And Balaam answered and said unto the servants of Balak, If Balak would give me his house full of silver and gold, I cannot go beyond the word of the Lord my God, to do less or more.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:18",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "Now therefore, I pray you, tarry ye also here this night, that I may know what the Lord will say unto me more.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:19",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "And God came unto Balaam at night, and said unto him, If the men come to call thee, rise up, and go with them; but yet the word which I shall say unto thee, that shalt thou do.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 93,
            "end": 96
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:20",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "And Balaam rose up in the morning, and saddled his ass, and went with the princes of Moab.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:21",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "And God’s anger was kindled because he went: and the angel of the Lord stood in the way for an adversary against him. Now he was riding upon his ass, and his two servants were with him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 171,
            "end": 175
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 22:22",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "And the ass saw the angel of the Lord standing in the way, and his sword drawn in his hand: and the ass turned aside out of the way, and went into the field: and Balaam smote the ass, to turn her into the way.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "2 Kgs. 6:17."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
